NOTICE
------
This repository wraps Google TimesFM-3.

- TimesFM *source code* is Apache-2.0.
- TimesFM *weights through 2.5* remain Apache-2.0.
- TimesFM 3.0 pretrained weights (`google/timesfm-3.0-pytorch`) are
  distributed under Google's `timesfm-non-commercial-license-v1.0` and
  are restricted to non-commercial, non-production use.

See:
https://huggingface.co/google/timesfm-3.0-pytorch
https://github.com/google-research/timesfm
